      <!-- Sliding Carriage + Extended Ground-Reaching 4-DOF Harvesting Arm (0.34m + 0.34m).
           Arm chain after the carriage 1.6 kg (ASSUMED, heavier servos): turret 0.75 (yaw motor + shoulder
           motor, so the shoulder motor mass is not in the upper arm), upper arm 0.35, forearm 0.30 (incl. the
           wrist servo), wrist/palm 0.15, fingers 2 x 0.025.
           No body gravcomp: MuJoCo applies body gravcomp to every DoF above the body, including the root
           freejoint (actuatorgravcomp only reroutes the arm hinges), which gave the chassis +8.3 N of free lift
           and hid the arm's tipping moment (review F1, MEASURED). Gravity is fed forward instead as a
           position-target offset tau_g / kp (arm_ik_solver.gravity_offsets via mj_rne, used by harvest_logic),
           so the arm motors carry the full gravity torque and /nandi/joint_states effort reports it. -->
      <body name="arm_carriage" pos="0.05 0 0.155">
        <joint name="gantry_slide" type="slide" axis="1 0 0" range="-0.26 0.26" damping="10.0" actuatorfrcrange="-80 80"/>
